{
  "version": "0.5-draft",
  "enabled": false,
  "notes": "Editable draft for the DSH aiw-orchestrator. enabled=false means this policy is not active. Each executor is a family of DSH subagent provider instances, one per model: the orchestrator resolves subagent_provider_template with the observed gateway model id and dispatches only to a provider of that exact name mounted in the profile, whose own configuration must pin the same model. Every gateway_model_id stays null until observed in the live /v1/models snapshot for the configured token.",
